        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Sierra Academy of Aeronautics, United States Air Force Strategic Air Command\n- Places: Atwater, California, Castle Air Force Base, Merced, Sacramento, California\n- Topics: aviation flight schools, military bases\n\nFacts:\n- Castle Air Force Base operated from 1941 to 1995 as a United States Air Force Strategic Air Command base.\n- Castle Air Force Base is located northeast of Atwater, northwest of Merced, and about 115 miles south of Sacramento, California.\n- Sierra Academy of Aeronautics is an aviation flight school headquartered in Atwater, California.\n- Sierra Academy of Aeronautics operates its training facility at the former Castle Air Force Base in Atwater, California.",
